  "title": "Custom printed takeaway and wrap boxes",
  "category": "takeaway-packaging",
  "status": "preview",
  "short_description": "Your lunch, boxed in your brand. Printed takeaway meal boxes and wrap boxes in 1–3 colours, on kraft or white board.",
  "description": "Two boxes cover most food-to-go menus: a tuck-top takeaway meal box for sandwiches, salads and hot food, and a long tuck-end wrap box for wraps, subs and baguettes. Both are printed with your logo in one, two or three colours on kraft or white board; gloss and matte lamination are quoted on request.\n\nBuild the whole order around one artwork: line the box with [custom printed greaseproof paper](/catering-supplies/greaseproof-paper/), seal it with [logo stickers](/catering-supplies/logo-stickers/) and send it out in a [printed takeaway bag](/paper-bags/printed-paper-bags/). Serving burgers or fried chicken? See our [burger boxes](/takeaway-packaging/burger-boxes/) and [chicken boxes](/takeaway-packaging/chicken-boxes/).\n\nYour digital proof and print plates are included in the price. Final specifications are confirmed with your written quote.",
  "benefits": [
    "1, 2 or 3 colour print",
    "Two box formats",
    "Your own artwork"
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Can I use my own design?",
      "a": "Yes. Share your logo or print-ready artwork when requesting a quote. We will confirm the artwork requirements for your chosen item, and you approve a digital proof before anything is printed."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if my artwork is not ready?",
      "a": "You can request a quote first and share your artwork later. Tell us what you have in mind and we can discuss the next steps."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the prices shown final?",
      "a": "The prices on this page are indicative and exclude VAT, which is added at 20%. Your digital proof and print plates are included, and delivery is free to a single UK mainland address. We confirm everything in a written quote before you commit."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can the boxes be laminated?",
      "a": "Gloss and matte lamination are available and are quoted on request. Select the finish you want and send us the configuration."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which box do I need?",
      "a": "The takeaway meal box suits sandwiches, salads and hot meals; the wrap box is long and narrow for wraps, subs and baguettes. Tell us what you serve and we will advise."
    },
    {
      "q": "When will my boxes arrive?",
      "a": "As a general guide, allow several weeks from artwork approval to delivery. We will confirm current timing with your quote."
    }
  ],
